        <tbody><tr><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">All in-app requests time out on mobile data, Wi-Fi fine</td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">System policy / app constraint</td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">Browser works on the same network</td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2"><code className="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono">adb shell cmd netpolicy get restrict-background</code></td></tr><tr><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">Works in foreground, stops receiving after ~15s in background</td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">Doze / App Standby</td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">Returning to foreground fixes it instantly</td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2"><code className="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono">adb shell dumpsys deviceidle</code></td></tr><tr><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">Only file downloads / updates stall, API calls fine</td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">DownloadManager constraint</td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">Task state <code className="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono">WAITING_FOR_NETWORK</code></td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2"><code className="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono">adb logcat -s DownloadManager</code></td></tr><tr><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">Only embedded web pages go blank or show <code className="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono">net::ERR_*</code></td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">WebView / cleartext</td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">Native list still loads</td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2"><Link href="/en/blog/apk-embedded-webview-blank-cleartext-not-permitted" className="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">Blank in-app WebView guide</Link></td></tr><tr><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">No connectivity at all, even on Wi-Fi</td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">TLS trust / proxy / DNS</td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2"><code className="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono">SSLHandshakeException</code></td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2"><Link href="/en/blog/apk-https-handshake-fails-untrusted-user-ca-pinning" className="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">Untrusted user CA and pinning</Link></td></tr><tr><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">Install itself fails with &quot;App not installed&quot;</td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2">Install-time gate, unrelated to network</td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2"><code className="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono">INSTALL_FAILED_*</code></td><td className="border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 px-3 py-2"><Link href="/en/blog/apk-install-failed-missing-shared-library-diagnosis" className="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">Missing shared library diagnosis</Link></td></tr></tbody>
